    "Common Attacker Actions": "- Session token prediction and forgery\n- Session hijacking using valid tokens\n- Session replay attacks\n- Privilege escalation using administrator tokens\n- Long-term persistence using reusable tokens\n- Automated attacks using stolen tokens\n- Token brute-force enumeration",
