    "Discovery Methods": "- Testing authentication endpoint with repeated failed attempts\n- Observing that authentication continues after many failures\n- Analyzing response patterns showing no degradation\n- Credential spraying attacks succeeding against service\n- Comparison with competing systems implementing lockout\n- Documentation review showing absence of lockout\n- Network analysis revealing sustained failed authentication",
