    "Common Attacker Actions": "- API key theft from code repositories\n- Unlimited API usage (cost attacks)\n- Data exfiltration using API access\n- Unauthorized API operations\n- Infrastructure modification via cloud APIs\n- Resource deletion/modification\n- Long-term persistence using static keys",
    "Related MITRE Techniques": "- T1552 — Unsecured Credentials\n- T1552.001 — Credentials in Files\n- T1552.002 — Credentials in Registry\n- T1552.003 — Credentials in Environment Variables\n- T1552.004 — Private Keys\n- T1552.007 — Container API Credentials\n- T1552.008 — Chat Application Credentials",
