    "Security Recommendations": "- Eliminate anonymous access where possible\n- Restrict anonymous access to minimum necessary resources\n- Require authentication for all sensitive operations\n- Implement strong access control on anonymous resources\n- Monitor anonymous user activity\n- Use different anonymous account per access session\n- Implement rate limiting on anonymous access\n- Require email verification before granting guest access\n- Log all anonymous access attempts\n- Review and justify each anonymous access point",
