    "Security Recommendations": "- Disable all guest accounts\n- Remove all demo/test accounts\n- Audit and remove unused accounts regularly\n- Enforce mandatory password change if guest account necessary\n- Restrict guest account permissions minimally\n- Monitor guest account activity\n- Implement MFA even for guest accounts\n- Document business justification for any guest account\n- Create separate limited demo accounts instead of guest\n- Implement time-limited guest access\n- Regular account audit removing unnecessary accounts",
    "Compliance References": "- CIS Controls: 5.1, 6.2\n- NIST SP 800-53: AC-2",
