    "Common Services": "- Web applications\n- APIs\n- Web services\n- Mobile applications\n- Administrative consoles",
    "Common Attacker Actions": "- Database structure enumeration\n- Software version identification\n- Vulnerability research based on versions\n- SQL injection attack refinement\n- File path discovery\n- Internal IP address discovery",
