    "Real World Abuse": "",
    "Scenario 1": "SQL injection attempt triggers error: \"Error on line 42: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = '' OR '1'='1' \". Attacker sees exact query structure. Refines injection attack. Extracts entire database.",
